## Acceptance Testing

All user stories from Sprint 1 and Sprint 2 must have at least
two acceptance tests.

Acceptance tests will be created as separate GitHub Issues,
assigned to team members, labeled appropriately, and linked
to the corresponding user stories and development tasks.

Each feature owner will be responsible for preparing and
validating acceptance tests for their assigned user stories.

